[142]={n="Of Wolves and Bears",p=6,d="One with nature, one with wildlife. Raw and animalistic power, sharpened senses, howling on the highest cliffs and roaring in the thickest forests - that's you."},
[143]={n="One Thousand and One",p=6,d="You feel at home under the hot desert sun with sand between your toes, and your favourite means of travel is a flying carpet. Also, you can probably do that head isolation dance mo"},
[144]={n="Oops",p=2,s=1,d="So much for your feathered little friend! Maybe standing in front of the birdcage, squeezing its neck and shouting 'Sing! Sing! Sing!' was a little too much for it?!"},
[145]={n="Out in the Snowstorm",p=4,d="Snow heaps and hailstorms can't keep you from where you want to go. You're perfectly equipped for any expedition into the perpetual ice and know how to keep your feet warm. If you'"},
[146]={n="Peazzekeeper",p=6,d="You're a humble warrior who doesn't need wealth or specialised equipment for travelling and fighting. You feel at home in the northern lands of Zao and did your part in fighting it"},
[147]={n="Piece of Cake",p=1,d="Life can be so easy with the right cake at the right time - and you mastered baking many different ones, so you should be prepared for almost everything life decides to throw at yo"},
[148]={n="Ritualist",p=6,d="You could be the author of the magnum opus 'How to Summon the Ultimate Beast from the Infernal Depths, Volume I'. Or, if your mind and heart are pure, you rather summon beings to h"},
[149]={n="Rock Me to Sleep",p=1,s=1,d="Sleeping - you do it with style. You're chilling in your hammock, listening to the sound of the birds and crickets as you slowly drift away into the realm of dreams."},
[150]={n="Rocket in Pocket",p=1,s=1,d="Either you are not a fast learner or you find some pleasure in setting yourself on fire. Or you're just looking for a fancy title. In any case, you should know that passing gas dur"},
[151]={n="Rollercoaster",p=1,d="Up and down and up and down... and then the big looping! Wait - they don't build loopings in Kazordoon. But ore wagon rides are still fun!"},
[152]={n="Santa's Li'l Helper",p=2,s=1,d="Christmas is your favourite time of the year, and boy, do you love presents. Buy some nice things for your friends, hide them away until - well, until you decide to actually unwrap"},
[153]={n="Sharpshooter",p=3,d="Improved eyesight, arrows and bolts flying at the speed of light and pinning your enemies with extra damage. All in a little bottle. No consumption of carrots required. For further"},
[154]={n="Skull and Bones",p=6,d="Wearing the insignia and dark robes of the Brotherhood of Bones you roam the lands spreading fear and pain, creating new soldiers for the necromantic army which is about to rise so"},
[155]={n="Slim Chance",p=1,d="Okay, let's face it - as long as you believe it could potentially lead you to the biggest treasure ever, you won't let go of that map, however fishy it might look. There must be a "},
[156]={n="Swashbuckler",p=6,d="Ye be a gentleman o' fortune, fightin' and carousin' on the high seas, out fer booty and lassies! Ye no be answerin' to no man or blasted monarchy and yer life ain't fer the lily-l"},
[157]={n="Sweet Tooth",p=2,s=1,d="The famous 'Ode to a Molten Chocolate Cake' was probably written by you. Spending a rainy afternoon in front of the chimney, wrapped in a blanket while indulging in cocoa delights "},
[158]={n="Swift Death",p=6,d="Stealth kills and backstabbing are you specialty. Your numerous victims are usually unaware of their imminent death, which you bring to them silently and swiftly. Everything is per"},
[159]={n="The Cake's the Truth",p=1,s=1,d="And anyone claiming otherwise is a liar."},
[160]={n="The Day After",p=2,s=1,d="Uhm... who's that person who you just woke up beside? Broken cocktail glasses on the floor, flowers all over the room, and why the heck are you wearing a ring? Yesterday must have "},
[161]={n="The Undertaker",p=2,s=1,d="You and your shovel - a match made in heaven. Or hell, for that matter. Somewhere down below in any case. You're magically attracted by stone piles and love to open them up and see"},
[162]={n="True Lightbearer",p=5,s=1,d="You're one of the most dedicated Lightbearers - without you, the demons would have torn the veil between the worlds for sure. You've lit each and every basin, travelling high and l"},
[163]={n="Warlock",p=6,d="You're proficient in the darker ways of magic and are usually found sitting inside a circle of candles and skulls muttering unspeakable words. Don't carry things too far or the dem"},
[164]={n="Way of the Shaman",p=6,d="Shaking your rattle and dancing around the fire to jungle drums sounds like something you like doing. Besides, dreadlocks are a convenient way to wear your hair - no combing requir"},
[165]={n="Wild Warrior",p=6,d="Valour is for weaklings - it doesn't matter how you win the battle, as long as you're victorious. Thick armor would just hinder your movements, thus you keep it light and rely on s"},
[166]={n="With a Cherry on Top",p=1,s=1,d="You like your cake soft, with fruity bits and a nice sugar icing. And you prefer to make them by yourself. Have you ever considered opening a bakery? You must be really good by now"},
[167]={n="Yalahari of Power",p=3,d="You defend Yalahar with brute force and are ready to lead it into a glorious battle, if necessary. Thanks to you, Yalahar will be powerful enough to stand up against any enemy."},
[168]={n="Yalahari of Wisdom",p=3,d="Your deeds for Yalahar are usually characterised by deep insight and thoughtful actions. Thanks to you, Yalahar might have a chance to grow peacefully and with happy people living "},
[169]={n="Afraid of no Ghost!",p=2,d="You passed their test and helped the Spirithunters testing equipment, researching the supernatural and catching ghosts - it's you they're gonna call."},
[170]={n="Ashes to Dust",p=4,s=1,d="Staking vampires and demons has almost turned into your profession. You make sure to gather even the tiniest amount of evil dust particles. Beware of silicosis."},
[171]={n="Baby Sitter",p=1,s=1,d="You have cheered up a demon baby and returned it to its mother. A quick count of your fingers will reveal if you made it through unharmed."},
[172]={n="Banebringers' Bane",p=2,s=1,d="You sacrificed a lot of ingredients to create the protective brew of the witches and played a significant part in the efforts to repel the dreaded banebringers. The drawback is tha"},
[173]={n="Berry Picker",p=4,s=1,d="The Combined Magical Winterberry Society hereby honours continued selfless dedication and extraordinary efforts in the Annual Autumn Vintage."},
[174]={n="Bunny Slipped",p=2,d="Indeed, you have a soft spot for rabbits. Maybe the rabbits you saved today will be the rabbits that will save you tomorrow. When you are really hungry."},
[175]={n="Cake Conqueror",p=1,d="You have bravely stepped onto the cake isle. Is there any more beautiful, tasty place to be in the whole world?"},
[176]={n="Dark Voodoo Priest",p=2,s=1,d="Sinister curses, evil magic - you don't shy away from punishing others by questionable means. Someone just gave you a strange look - now where's that needle again?"},
[177]={n="Extreme Degustation",p=2,s=1,d="Almost all the plants you tested for Chartan in Zao where inedible - you tasted them all, yet you're still standing! You should really get some fresh air now, though."},
[178]={n="Fire Devil",p=3,s=1,d="To keep the witches' fire burning, you trashed a lot of the wood the bane bringers animated. Some might find your fascination for fire ... disturbing."},
[179]={n="Fire Lighter",p=1,s=1,d="You have helped to keep the witches fire burning. Just watch your fingers, it's hot!"},
[180]={n="Ghost Sailor",p=1,s=1,d="You have sailed the nether seas with the Ghost Captain. Despite the perils, you and your fellow crewmen have braved the challenge."},
[181]={n="Guinea Pig",p=2,d="True scientists know their equipment. Testing new inventions is essential daily work for any hard working researcher. You showed no fear and took all the new equipment from Spectul"},
[182]={n="Hidden Powers",p=2,d="You've discovered the Ancients' hidden powers - from now on, they will aid you in your adventures."},
[183]={n="Honorary Witch",p=4,s=1,d="Your efforts in fighting back the banebringers has not gone unnoticed. You are a legend amongst the witches and your name is whispered with awe and admiration."},
[184]={n="I Like it Fancy",p=1,s=1,d="You definitely know how to bring out the best in your furniture and decoration pieces. Beautiful."},
[185]={n="Master Shapeshifter",p=2,s=1,d="You have mastered Kuriks challenge in all possible shapes."},
[186]={n="Merry Adventures",p=2,d="You went into the forest, met Rottin Wood and the Married Men and helped them out in their camp. Oh, and don't worry about those merchants. They won't dare mentioning the strangely"},
[187]={n="Nanny from Hell",p=3,s=1,d="You have cheered up a bunch of demon babies and returned them to their mother. Don't bother the burn marks, don't bother the strains of grey hair, don't bother the nights you wake "},
[188]={n="Natural Born Cowboy",p=1,s=1,d="Oh, the joy of riding! You've just got your very first own mount. Conveniently enough you don't even need stables, but can summon it any time you like."},
[189]={n="Nether Pirate",p=3,s=1,d="Not fearing death or ghosts you have traveled with the ghost captain several times and are a seasoned traveler of the netherworld. The dead and the living whisper about your exploi"},
[190]={n="Nomad Soul",p=2,s=1,d="Home is where your current favourite hunting ground is, and though you might hold certain places more dear than others you never feel attached enough to really stay in one city for"},
[191]={n="Petrologist",p=2,s=1,d="Stones have always fascinated you. So has the chance of finding something really precious inside one of them. Statistically you should've discovered a few nice treasures by now. Bu"},
[192]={n="Pyromaniac",p=4,s=1,d="Love ... fire! So ... shiny! Must ... buuuurrrn!"},
[193]={n="Safely Stored Away",p=2,s=1,d="Don't worry, no one will be able to take it from you. Probably."},
[194]={n="Scourge of Death",p=5,s=1,d="You are a master of the nether sea and have traveled with the ghost captain so many times that you know his ship and the perils of the nether sea inside out. You laugh in the face "},
[195]={n="Silent Pet",p=1,s=1,d="Awww. Your very own little goldfish friend - he's cute, he's shiny and he can't complain should you forget to feed him. He'll definitely brighten up your day!"},
[196]={n="Skin-Deep",p=4,s=1,d="You always carry your obsidian knife with you and won't hesitate to use it. You've skinned countless little - and bigger - critters and yeah: they usually don't get any more beauti"},
[197]={n="Snowbunny",p=2,s=1,d="Hopping, hopping through the snow - that's the funnest way to go! Making footprints in a flurry - it's more fun the more you hurry! Licking icicles all day - Winter, never go away!"},
[198]={n="Something's in There",p=1,s=1,d="By the gods! What was that?"},
[199]={n="Spectral Traveler",p=2,s=1,d="You have sailed the nether seas with the Ghost Captain several times. The dangers of the nether have become familiar to you and unexperienced travelers turn to you for advice."},
[200]={n="True Colours",p=3,s=1,d="You and your friends showed the three wizards your loyalty three times - I am sure at least one of them is probably eternally thankful and exceedingly proud of you."},
[201]={n="Truth Be Told",p=2,s=1,d="You told Jack the truth by explaining you and Spectulus made a mistake when trying to convince him of being a completely different person."},
[202]={n="Witches Lil' Helper",p=1,s=1,d="You sacrificed ingredients to create the protective brew of the witches."},
[203]={n="You Don't Know Jack",p=2,s=1,d="You did not tell Jack the truth about the mistake you and Spectulus made when trying to convince him about being a completely different person. He will live in doubt until the end "},
[204]={n="Askarak Nemesis",p=1,s=1,d="You are now the royal archfiend of the Askarak, prince slayer."},
[205]={n="Beak Doctor",p=4,d="You significantly helped the afflicted citizens of Venore in times of dire need. Somehow you still feel close to the victims of the fever outbreak. Your clothes make you one of the"},
[206]={n="Biodegradable",p=1,s=1,d="You caught fifty rare shimmer swimmers. Getting rid of all those corpses by dumping them into the lake really was worth it, wasn't it? Wait, didn't something move in the water just"},
[207]={n="Deer Hunt",p=1,s=1,d="You managed to kill more than four hundred white deer - it looks like you are one of the main reasons they will soon be considered extinct, way to go!"},
[208]={n="Doctor! Doctor!",p=2,s=1,d="Did someone call a doctor? You delivered 100 medicine bags to Ottokar of the Venore poor house in times of dire need, well done!"},
[209]={n="Eye of the Deep",p=1,s=1,d="You didn't look into it - at least not for too long... but Groam did. And you relieved him. Just don't tell his friend Dronk."},
[210]={n="Firefighter",p=2,s=1,d="You extinguished 500 thornfires! You were there when the Firestarters took over Shadowthorn. You saved the day - and the home of some elves which will try to kill you nonetheless. "},
[211]={n="Invader of the Deep",p=2,s=1,d="Many creatures of the deep have lost their lives by your hand. Three hundred have entered the depths of eternity. You should probably fear the revenge of the Eyes of the Deep."},
[212]={n="Mageslayer",p=1,s=1,d="You killed the raging mage in his tower south of Zao. Again. But this one just keeps coming back. The dimensional portal collapsed once more and you know he will eventually return "},
[213]={n="Mystic Fabric Magic",p=4,d="You vanquished the mad mage, you subdued the raging mage - no spellweaving self-exposer can stand in your way. Yet you are quite absorbed in magical studies yourself. This very fab"},
[214]={n="Shaburak Nemesis",p=1,s=1,d="You are now the public archenemy of the Shaburak, prince slayer."},
[215]={n="Slimer",p=1,s=1,d="With the assistance of your friendly little helper, you gobbled more than 500 chunks of slime. Well done, Slimer."},
[216]={n="Arachnoise",p=1,d="You've shattered each of Bloodweb's eight frozen legs. As they say: break a leg, and then some more."},
[217]={n="Back into the Abyss",p=1,d="You've cut off a whole lot of tentacles today. Thul was driven back to where he belongs."},
[218]={n="Beautiful Agony",p=2,d="Ethershreck's cry of agony kept ringing in your ear for hours after he had dissolved into thin air. He probably moved to another plane of existence... for a while."},
[219]={n="Blood-Red Snapper",p=1,d="You've tainted the jungle floor with the Snapper's crimson blood."},
[220]={n="Breaking the Ice",p=1,d="You almost made friends with Shardhead... before he died. Poor guy only seems to attract violence with his frosty attitude."},
[221]={n="Choking on Her Venom",p=1,d="The Old Widow fell prey to your supreme hunting skills."},
[222]={n="Crawling Death",p=1,d="You ripped the ancient scarab Fleshcrawler apart and made sure he didn't get under your skin."},
[223]={n="Hissing Downfall",p=2,d="You've vansquished the Noxious Spawn and his serpentine heart."},
[224]={n="Just Cracked Me Up!",p=2,d="Stonecracker's head was much softer than the stones he threw at you."},
[225]={n="Meat Skewer",p=1,d="You've impaled the big mammoth Bloodtusk with his own tusks."},
[226]={n="No More Hiding",p=1,d="You've found a well-hidden spider queen and caught her off guard in the middle of her meal."},
[227]={n="One Less",p=2,d="The Many is no more, but how many more are there? One can never know."},
[228]={n="Pwned a Lot of Fur",p=8,s=1,d="You've faced and defeated a lot of the mighty bosses the Paw and Fur society sent you out to kill. All by yourself. What a hunt!"},
[229]={n="Rootless Behaviour",p=1,d="You've descended into the swampy depths of Deathbine's lair and made quick work of it."},
[230]={n="Scorched Flames",p=1,d="A mighty blaze went out today. It's Flameborn's turn to wait for his rebirth in the eternal cycle of life and death."},
[231]={n="Something Smells",p=1,d="You've exinguished the Sulphur Scuttler's gas clouds and made the air in his cave a little better... at least for a while."},
[232]={n="Spareribs for Dinner",p=1,d="Ribstride is striding no more. He had quite a few ribs to spare though."},
[233]={n="The Drowned Sea God",p=2,d="As the killer of Leviathan, the giant sea serpent, his underwater kingdom is now under your reign."},
[234]={n="The Gates of Hell",p=2,d="It seems the gates to the underworld have to remain unprotected for a while. Kerberos, the mighty hellhound, lost his head. All three of them."},
[235]={n="The Serpent's Bride",p=2,d="You made a knot with Gorgo's living curls and took her scalp. You couldn't save her countless petrified victims, but at least you didn't become one."},
[236]={n="Twisted Mutation",p=1,d="You've slain Esmeralda, the most hideous and aggressive of the mutated rats. No one will know that you almost lost a finger in the process."},
[237]={n="Bane of the Hive",p=2,d="Countless fights and never tiring effort in the war against the hive grant you the experience to finish your outfit with the last remaining part. Your chitin outfit is a testament "},
[238]={n="Chest Robber",p=1,d="You've discovered three nomad camps and stole their supplies. Well, you can probably use them better then they can."},
[239]={n="Chitin Bane",p=4,d="You have become competent and efficient in gathering the substance that is needed to fight the hive. You almost smell like dissolved chitin and the Hive Born would tell their child"},
[240]={n="Confusion",p=3,d="The destruction you have caused by now can be felt throughout the whole hive. The mayhem that follows your step caused significant confusion in the consciousness of the hive."},
[241]={n="Dazzler",p=3,d="In the war against the hive, your efforts in blinding it begin to pay off. Your actions have blinded the hive severely and the entity seems to become aware that something dangerous"},
[242]={n="Death Song",p=3,d="You hushed the songs of war in the black depths by sliencing more than three hundred Deepling Spellsingers."},
[243]={n="Depth Dwellers",p=3,d="By eliminating at least three hundred Deepling Warriors you delivered quite a blow to the amassing armies of the deep."},
[244]={n="Desert Fisher",p=1,d="You managed to catch a fish in a surrounding that usually doesn't even carry water. Everything is subject to change, probably..."},
[245]={n="Dog Sitter",p=1,d="You showed Noodles the way home. How long will it take this time until he's on the loose again? That dog must be really bored in the throne room by now."},
[246]={n="Down the Drain",p=2,d="You've found a secret dungeon in the flooded plains and killed several of its inhabitants. And now you have wet feet."},
[247]={n="Exterminator",p=4,d="Efficient and lethal, you have gained significant experience in fighting the elite forces of the hive. Almost single-handed, you have slain the best of the Hive Born and live to te"},
[248]={n="Fire from the Earth",p=2,d="You've survived the Hellgorge eruption and found a way through the flames and lava. You've even managed to kill a few fireborn on the way."},
[249]={n="Gatherer",p=2,d="By killing creatures of the hive and gaining weapons for further missions, you started a quite effective way of war. You gathered a lot of dissolved chitin to resupply the war effo"},
[250]={n="Gem Cutter",p=1,s=1,d="You cut your first gem - and it bears your own name! Now that would be a nice gift! This does not make it a \"true\" Heart of the Sea, however..."},
[251]={n="Goldhunter",p=2,s=1,d="	If it wasn't for you, several banks in the World would've gotten bankrupt by now. Keep on chasing bank robbers and no one will have to worry about the World economy!"},
[252]={n="Guard Killer",p=2,d="You have proven that you can beat the best of the hive. You have caused first promising breaches in the defence of the hive"},
[253]={n="Guardian Downfall",p=4,d="You ended the life of over three hundred Deepling Guards. Not quite the guardian of the Deeplings, are you?"},
[254]={n="Headache",p=2,d="Even in the deepest structures of the hive, you began to strike against the mighty foe. Your actions probably already gave the hive a headache."},
[255]={n="Heartburn",p=3,d="Never-tiring, you attack the inner organs of the mighty hive. Your attacks on the hive's digestion system begin to cause some trouble."},
[256]={n="Hickup",p=2,d="You have grown accustomed to frequenting the hive's stomach system. Your actions have caused the hive some first digestion problems."},
[257]={n="Hive Blinder",p=4,d="You have put a lot of time and energy into keeping the hive unaware of what is happening on Quirefang. The hive learnt to fear your actions. It would surely crush you with all its "},
[258]={n="Hive Fighter",p=1,d="You have participated that much in the hive war, that you are able to create some makeshift armor from the remains of dead hive born that can be found in the major hive, to show of"},
[259]={n="Hive Infiltrator",p=3,d="The most powerful warriors of the hive were killed by you by the dozens. The hive is not safe anymore because of your actions."},
[260]={n="Hive War Veteran",p=1,d="Your invaluable experience in fighting the hive allows you to add another piece of armor to your chitin outfit to proove your dedication for the cause."},
[261]={n="Honest Finder",p=1,d="You've stopped the bank robber and returned the bag full of gold. Good to know there are still lawful citizens like you around."},
[262]={n="Ice Harvester",p=1,d="You witnessed the thawing of Svargrond and harvested rare seeds from some strange icy plants. They must be good for something."},
[263]={n="Loyal Subject",p=1,d="You joined the Kingsday festivities and payed the King your respects. Now, off to party!"},
[264]={n="Manic",p=4,d="You have destroyed a significant amount of the hive's vital nerve centres and caused massive destruction to the hive's awareness. You are probably causing the hive horrible nightma"},
[265]={n="Minor Disturbance",p=2,d="Your actions start to make a difference. You have blinded the antennae of the hive often enough to become an annoyance to it."},
[266]={n="Navigational Error",p=5,s=1,d="You confronted the Navigator."},
[267]={n="Pimple",p=3,d="You are getting more and more experienced in destroying the supply of the enemy's forces. Your actions caused the hive some severe skin problems."},
[268]={n="Planter",p=2,d="The hive has to be fought with might and main, hampering its soldiers is only the first step. You diligently stopped the pores of the hive to spread its warriors."},
[269]={n="Preservationist",p=1,s=1,d="You are a pretty smart thinker and managed to create everlasting flowers. They might become a big hit with all the people who aren't blessed with a green thumb or just forgetful."},
[270]={n="Si, Ariki!",p=1,d="You've found the oriental traveller Yasir and were able to trade with him - even if you didn't really understand his language."},
[271]={n="Someone's Bored",p=1,s=1,d="That was NOT a giant spider. There's some witchcraft at work here."},
[272]={n="Spolium Profundis",p=4,d="You travelled the depths of this very world. You entered the blackness of the deep sea to conquer the realm of the Deeplings. May this suit remind you of the strange beauty below."},
[273]={n="Stomach Ulcer",p=4,d="You severely disrupted the digestion of the hive. The hive should for sure see a doctor. It seems you proved to be more than it can swallow."},
[274]={n="Supplier",p=3,d="The need for supplies often decides over loss or victory. Your tireless efforts to resupply the resources keeps the war against the hive going."},
[275]={n="Suppressor",p=4,d="A war is won by those who have the best supply of troops. The hive's troops have been dealt a significant blow by your actions. You interrupted the hive's replenishment of troops l"},
[276]={n="Torn Treasures",p=1,s=1,d="Wyda seems to be really, really bored. You also found out that she doesn't really need all those blood herbs that adventurers brought her. Still, she was nice enough to take one fr"},
[277]={n="Trail of the Ape God",p=1,s=1,d="You've discovered a trail of giant footprints and Terrified Elephants running everywhere. Could it be that the mysterious Ape God is rambling in the jungle?"},
[278]={n="Whistle-Blower",p=1,s=1,d="You can't keep a secret, can you? Then again, you're just fulfilling your duty to the Queen of Carlin as a lawful citizen. That's a good thing, isn't it...?"},
[279]={n="Back from the Dead",p=2,d="You overcame the undead Zanakeph and sent him back into the darkness that spawned him."},
[280]={n="Dream's Over",p=1,d="No more fear and bad dreams. You stabbed Tormentor to death with its scythe leg."},
[281]={n="Enter zze Draken!",p=2,d="You gave zzze draken a tazte of your finizzzing move."},
[282]={n="Howly Silence",p=1,d="You muted the everlasting howling of Hemming."},
[283]={n="Kapow!",p=1,d="No joke, you murdered the bat."},
[284]={n="King of the Ring",p=2,d="Bretzecutioner's body just got slammed away. You are a true king of the ring!"},
[285]={n="Pwned All Fur",p=8,s=1,d="You've faced and defeated each of the mighty bosses the Paw and Fur society sent you out to kill. All by yourself. What a hunt!"},
[286]={n="Stepped on a Big Toe",p=1,d="This time you knocked out the big one."},
[287]={n="Zzztill Zzztanding!",p=1,d="You wiped Fazzrah away - zzeemzz like now you're the captain."},
[288]={n="Becoming a Bigfoot",p=1,d="You did it! You convinced the reclusive gnomes to accept you as one of their Bigfoots. Now you are ready to help them. With big feet big missions seen to come."},
[289]={n="Bibby's Bloodbath",p=1,s=1,d="You lend a helping hand in defeating invading Orcs by destroying their warcamp along with their leader. Bibby's personal bloodbath..."},
[290]={n="Call Me Sparky",p=1,d="Admittedly you enjoyed the killing as usual. But the part with the sparks still gives you shivers ... or is it that there is some charge left on you?"},
[291]={n="Crystal Clear",p=3,d="If the gnomes had told you that crystal armor is see-through you had probably changed your underwear in time."},
[292]={n="Crystal Keeper",p=1,d="So you repaired the light of some crystals for those gnomes. What's next? Sitting a week in a mushroom bed as a temporary mushroom?"},
[293]={n="Crystals in Love",p=1,d="You brought two loving crystals together. Perhaps they might even name one of their children after you. To bad you forgot to leave your calling card."},
[294]={n="Death from Below",p=2,s=1,d="The face of the enemy is unmasked. You have encountered one of 'those below' and survived. More than that, you managed to kill the beast and prove once and for all that the enemy c"},
[295]={n="Death on Strike",p=4,s=1,d="Again and again Deathstrike has fallen to your prowess. Perhaps it's time for people calling YOU Deathstrike from now on."},
[296]={n="Diplomatic Immunity",p=4,s=1,d="You killed the ambassador of the abyss that often that they might consider sending another one. Perhaps that will one day stop further intrusions."},
[297]={n="Dungeon Cleaner",p=3,s=1,d="Seen it all. Done it all. Your unstoppable force swept through the dungeons and you vanquished their masters. Not to forget the precious loot you took! Now stop reading this and co"},
[298]={n="Fall of the Fallen",p=4,s=1,d="Have you ever wondered how he reappears again and again? You only care for the loot, do you? Gotcha!"},
[299]={n="Final Strike",p=2,s=1,d="The mighty Deathstrike is dead! One legend is dead and you're on your way to become one yourself."},
[300]={n="Funghitastic",p=3,d="Finally your dream to become a walking mushroom has come true ... No, wait a minute!"},
[301]={n="Gnome Friend",p=2,d="The gnomes are warming up to you. One or two of them might actually bother to remember your name. You're allowed to access their gnomebase alpha. You are prepared to boldly put you"},
[302]={n="Gnome Little Helper",p=1,d="You think the gnomes start to like you. A little step for a Bigfoot but a big step for humanity."},
[303]={n="Gnomebane's Bane",p=2,s=1,d="The fallen gnome is dead and justice served. But what was it that the gnome whispered with his last breath? He's your father???"},
[304]={n="Gnomelike",p=3,d="You have become a household name in gnomish society! Your name is mentioned by gnomes more than once. Of course usually by gnomish mothers whose children refuse to eat their mushro"},
[305]={n="Gnomish Art Of War",p=3,d="You have unleashed your inner gnome and slain some of the most fearsome threats that gnomekind has ever faced. Now you can come and go to the warzones as it pleases you. The enemie"},
[306]={n="Goo Goo Dancer",p=1,s=1,d="Seeing a mucus plug makes your heart dance and you can't resist to see what it hides. Goo goo away!"},
[307]={n="Grinding Again",p=1,d="Burnt fingers and itching lungs are a small price for bringing those gnomes some lousy stone and getting almost killed! Your mother warned you to better become a farmer."},
[308]={n="Honorary Gnome",p=4,d="You accomplished what few humans ever will: you truly impressed the gnomes. This might not change their outlook on humanity as a whole, but at least you can bathe in gnomish respec"},
[309]={n="Nestling",p=1,d="You cleansed the land from an eight legged nuisance by defeating Mamma Longlegs three times. She won't be back soon... or will she?"},
[310]={n="One Foot Vs. Many",p=1,d="One Bigfoot won over thousands of tiny feet. Perhaps the gnomes are wrong and size matters?"},
[311]={n="Spore Hunter",p=1,d="After hunting for the correct mushrooms and their spores you're starting to feel like a mushroom yourself. A few times more and you might start thinking like a mushroom, who knows?"},
[312]={n="Substitute Tinker",p=1,d="Ring-a-ding! You have visited the golem workshop and lent a hand in repairing them. To know those golems are safe is worth all the bruises, isn't it?"},
[313]={n="The Picky Pig",p=1,d="The gnomes decided their pigs need some exclusive diet and you had to do all the dirty work - but wasn't the piglet adorable?"},
[314]={n="Task Manager",p=2,s=1,d="Helping a poor, stupid goblin to feed his starving children and wifes feels good ... if you'd only get rid of the strange feeling that you're missing something."},
[315]={n="True Dedication",p=5,s=1,d="You conquered the demon challenge and prevailed... now show off your success in style!"},
[316]={n="Gravedigger",p=3,d="Assisting Omrabas' sick plan to resurrect made you dig your way through the blood-soaked halls of Drefia. Maybe better he failed!"},
[317]={n="Repenter",p=1,s=1,d="You cleansed your soul in serving the Repenter enclave and purified thine self in completing all tasks in a single day of labour."},
[318]={n="Cave Completionist",p=2,d="	You have helped the gnomes of the spike in securing the caves and explored enough of the lightles depths to earn you a complete cave explorers outfit. Well done!"},
[319]={n="Dream Warden",p=5,d="It doesn't matter what noise you would hear... dream, nightmare, illusion - there is nothing you can't vanquish. You are a true Dream Warden."},
[320]={n="Dream Wright",p=1,d="You have mended many a broken dream and so, the dream of Roshamuul is safely being told over and over again."},
[321]={n="Ending the Horror",p=2,d="You have cleansed the lands of many retching horrors. You sure know how to end a bad dream: forcefully, that's how!"},
[322]={n="Luring Silence",p=2,d="What a scientific discovery - they really DO communicate! Using their own communication habits against them, you lured a large pack of silencers away from the walls of Roshamuul."},
[323]={n="Never Surrender",p=3,d="You did not show any signs of surrender to any sight of... you get the picture. Even a hundred of them did not pose a threat to you."},
[324]={n="Nevermending Story",p=3,s=1,d="You collected all of the mysterious bottle messages around the island of Roshamuul and located the remains of the first mate. Time will tell if his tale of mending an evil ring hol"},
[325]={n="Noblesse Obliterated",p=6,d="After a battle like this you know who your friends are."},
[326]={n="Prison Break",p=8,d="Gaz'haragoth... a day to remember! Your world accomplished someting really big - and you have been part of it!"},
[327]={n="Sleepwalking",p=1,d="You know your way, in dream and waking. And how to make tea that transcends the boundaries of conscience."},
[328]={n="Umbral Archer",p=6,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify your bow into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world."},
[329]={n="Umbral Berserker",p=6,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify your hammer into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world."},
[330]={n="Umbral Bladelord",p=6,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify your slayer into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world."},
[331]={n="Umbral Brawler",p=6,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify your mace into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world."},
[332]={n="Umbral Executioner",p=6,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify your chopper into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world."},
[333]={n="Umbral Harbringer",p=6,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify your spellbook into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world."},
[334]={n="Umbral Headsman",p=6,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify your axe into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world."},
[335]={n="Umbral Marksman",p=6,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify your crossbow into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world."},
[336]={n="Umbral Master",p=8,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify all kinds of weapons into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world. Respect!"},
[337]={n="Umbral Swordsman",p=6,d="You managed to transform, improve and sacrify your blade into a master state and have proven yourself worthy in a nightmarish world."},
[338]={n="Combo Master",p=1,s=1,d="You accomplished 10 or more consecutive chains in a row! That's killing at least 39 creatures in the correct order - now that's combinatorics!"},
[339]={n="Elementary, My Dear",p=1,d="Through the spirit of science and exploration, you have discovered how to enter the secret hideout of the renowned Dr Merlay."},
[340]={n="Glooth Engineer",p=5,d="Though you might have averted a dire threat for Rathleton, this relative peace may only hold for a while. At least you've scavenged an outfit from some of the poor fellows that hav"},
[341]={n="Rathleton Citizen",p=1,d="By having rendered numerous services to the city of Rathleton you have been promoted to the rank of Citizen."},
[342]={n="Rathleton Commoner",p=1,d="By having rendered numerous services to the city of Rathleton you have been promoted to the rank of Commoner."},
[343]={n="Rathleton Inhabitant",p=1,d="By having rendered numerous services to the city of Rathleton you have been promoted to the rank of Inhabitant."},
[344]={n="Seasoned Adventurer",p=1,d="Adventure is your middle name. You spent much time in dangerous lands and have seen things others only dream of. You know your way around in the World - you are a seasoned adventur"},
[345]={n="Go with da Lava Flow",p=1,s=1,d="You escaped the glowing hot lava death trap, Professor Maxxen has set for you - Captain Caveworm is indeed proud!"},
[346]={n="Lion's Den Explorer",p=1,s=1,d="You discovered the Lion's Rock, passed the tests to enter the inner sanctum and finally revealed the secrets of the buried temple. You literally put your head in the lion's mouth a"},
[347]={n="Mind the Step!",p=1,d="You've got a mind ready to draw strange conclusions that defy the laws of logic and sidestep reality. Or maybe it's just a lucky guess - or adventurous recklessness?"},
[348]={n="Plant vs. Minos",p=4,s=1,d="You have defeated the wallbreaker and saved the glooth plant."},
[349]={n="Publicity",p=1,d="You are a man of the public. Or of good publicity at least. Through your efforts in advertising the airtight cloth, Zeronex might yet be redeemed - and Rathleton might yet see its "},
[350]={n="Rathleton Squire",p=1,d="By having rendered numerous services to the city of Rathleton you have been promoted to the rank of Squire."},
[351]={n="Robo Chop",p=4,s=1,d="You have defeated the glooth bomb and chopped down a lot of metal monsters on your way."},
[352]={n="Rumble in the Plant",p=4,s=1,d="You have defeated the tremor worm - and wonder what kind of fish you'd be able to catch with such a bait."},
[353]={n="Snake Charmer",p=1,d="By restoring the Everhungry Altar, you charmed the Fire-Feathered Sea Serpent back into its fitful sleep, twenty miles beneath the sea."},
[354]={n="The Professor's Nut",p=3,d="He seriously stored away a wallnut? That was a nutty professor indeed."},
[355]={n="Wail of the Banshee",p=1,s=1,d="You saw the Crystal Gardens with all their stunning beauty and survived the equally impressive monsters there. In the end you discovered a great evil and destroyed it with the help"},
[356]={n="Bearbaiting",p=1,d="Hunter's greeting! Your skillful use of the slingshot actually stunned a large bear. The creature is slightly dazed, but seems susceptible to your commands. Let's declare open seas"},
[357]={n="Beneath the Sea",p=3,d="Not really twenty thousand miles, but you had to dive a fair way beneath the sea to find your personal Manta Ray."},
[358]={n="Blacknailed",p=1,d="Well, you can rest your nailcase now. This gravedigger's fingernails are nice and clean. Though after the next hellride, you might not want to let it hand any food to you."},
[359]={n="Cartography 101",p=2,d="You succeeded in finding and charting several previously unexplored landmarks and locations for the Adventurer's Guild, you probably never need to ask anyone for the way - do you?"},
[360]={n="Chequered Teddy",p=1,d="Don't let its fluffy appearance deceive you. The panda is a creature of the wild. It will take you to the most distant regions of the World, always in hopes of a little bamboo to n"},
[361]={n="Dragon Mimicry",p=2,d="It's not really a dragon, but rather a kind of chimera. Nonetheless a decent mount to impress any passer-by."},
[362]={n="Fabled Construction",p=3,d="Finding all the pieces to this complicated vehicle was one kind of a challenge. However, what you built in the end is rather a fabled than a feeble construction."},
[363]={n="Fata Morgana",p=2,d="There are many delusions and phantasms in the desert. You saw a false oasis with fruit-bearing palm trees. Instead of water and refreshment, however, you found a dromedary in the e"},
[364]={n="Fried Shrimp",p=2,d="This must be underwater love - this enormous crustacean now does thy bidding. Or maybe it's just in it for a little more of that shrimp barbecue, as that's a little hard to come by"},
[365]={n="Friend of Elves",p=1,d="Kingly deer mostly prefer elves as friends and familiars. This one, however, decided to favour you as a confidant and rider. Well done!"},
[366]={n="Gear Up",p=3,d="Installing that control unit was a no-brainer. Now you're in control to make it walk this way or that, or to change tack at any moment if required. Your faithful walker mount obeys"},
[367]={n="Golden Sands",p=3,d="Counting ten thousand grains of sand could not have been harder than gaining this impressive mount."},
[368]={n="Hoard of the Dragon",p=1,s=1,d="Your adventurous way through countless dragon lairs earned you a pretty treasure - and surely the enmity of many a dragon."},
[369]={n="Icy Glare",p=1,d="Here's looking at you, kid. This ancient creature seems to size you up with its brilliant eyes and barely tolerates you riding it. Maybe it thinks you're the defrosted snack, after"},
[370]={n="Knock on Wood",p=3,d="It's a wound-up wooden lizard! Well, stranger things have happened, or so you're told. Just hop on and let this wood-and-tin contraption take you anywhere you want to wind down a b"},
[371]={n="Lion King",p=1,d="By mastering the secrets of Lion's Rock, you proved yourself worthy to face the mighty lions there. One of them even chose to accompany you."},
[372]={n="Little Ball of Wool",p=1,d="You found a lost sheep and thus a steady source of black wool. But careful: don't get entangled."},
[373]={n="Lost Palace Raider",p=2,s=1,d="Lifting the secrets of a fabulous palace and defeating a beautiful demon princess was a thrilling experience indeed. This site's marvels nearly matched its terrors. Nearly."},
[374]={n="Lovely Dots",p=3,d="Finding a four-leaved clover is always a sign of luck. And as luck would have it, you even baited a lovely dotted ladybug. Lucky you!"},
[375]={n="Loyal Lad",p=1,d="Having a loyal friend alongside is comforting to every adventurer. If only this lad was not so stubborn..."},
[376]={n="Lucky Horseshoe",p=1,d="'Sweets for my steed' could be your motto. An impressive horse is eating out of your hand. Saddle up and be ready to find adventure, new friends, and maybe someone to shoe your hor"},
[377]={n="Luminous Kitty",p=3,d="You made some efforts to bring a little more light into the world. And what a nice present you got in return!"},
[378]={n="Magnetised",p=2,d="This magnetic beast attracted you in a very literal way. Or was it attracted by your metal equipment? Anyway, you seem to be stuck together now."},
[379]={n="Mind the Dog!",p=2,d="Barking dogs never bite, as the saying goes. But this one clearly tried. In the end, however, you were able to walk the dog - ahem, gnarlhound."},
[380]={n="Out of the Stone Age",p=3,d="What a blast from the past! This thankful patient thinks you missed your dentist vocation. It's now ready to take a bite of the future and to carry you to your next adventure, or y"},
[381]={n="Pecking Order",p=1,d="Ah, the old carrot-on-a-stick trick. Well done! You've made the racing bird accept you as a rider and provider. Just don't feed it your fingers."},
[382]={n="Personal Nightmare",p=3,d="It might come as a shock to you, but this is the mount of your dreams. Not exactly the white steed of Prince Charming, but maybe the ladies will still scream and faint at the sight"},
[383]={n="Pig-Headed",p=2,d="Whoa, sow long! This boar is like a force of nature, breaking through the undergrowth of all the forests and all records of speed. Hang on!"},
[384]={n="Scales and Tail",p=2,d="The Muggy Plains are a dangerous place, often raided by dragons. But that was your luck: thus you found this scaly little guy."},
[385]={n="Slugging Around",p=2,d="Drugging a snail can have some beneficial side effects. You're now the proud owner of a snarling, speed-crazy slug. Maybe it'll purr if you stroke it. Anyway, life should be one sl"},
[386]={n="Spin-Off",p=1,d="Seems like this spider has got a sweet tooth. As a result, eight hairy legs are now at your disposal to crawl and weave at your whim, and strike fear into the hearts of men."},
[387]={n="Starless Night",p=3,d="By many it is considered a myth like the Yeti. But you came, saw and tamed it. Now you're the proud rider of a midnight panther, black as a starless night."},
[388]={n="Stuntman",p=3,d="A drop of oil and you're good to go. This unique mount will roll merrily in and out of any strange place you want to visit. If you see no exit, you probably ended up in a circus ri"},
[389]={n="Swamp Beast",p=1,d="By cleverly using a leech to cool that raging bull's blood, you managed not to get swamped or trampled in a water buffalo stampede. The creature is now docile and follows your ever"},
[390]={n="The Right Tone",p=1,d="By setting the right tone you convinced a crystal wolf to accompany you. Remember it is made of crystal, though, so be careful in a banshee's presence."},
[391]={n="Thick-Skinned",p=2,d="It's unstoppable! Walls? Fortresses? Obstacles? Objections? Pah! Nothing will stand before the stampor. Arrows and spears bounce off its hide, enemies are trampled by the dozen. Ju"},
[392]={n="Way to Hell",p=2,d="This fiery beast really tried to give you hell. But not even a magma crawler can resist a mug of spicy, hot glow wine. Skol!"},
[393]={n="Hat Hunter",p=5,d="You sucessfully fought against all odds to protect your world from an ascending god! – You weren't there for the hat only after all?"},
[394]={n="Ogre Chef",p=1,d="You didn't manage to become an ogre chief. But at least you are, beyond doubt, a worthy ogre chef."},
[395]={n="Rift Warrior",p=3,d="You went through hell. Seven times. You defeated the demons. Countless times. You put an end to Ferumbras claims to ascendancy. Once and for all."},
[396]={n="The Call of the Wild",p=2,d="You opposed man-eating ogres and clumsy clomps. You grappled with hungry chieftains, desperate goblins and angry spirits. So you truly overcame the wild vastness of Krailos."},
[397]={n="Ender of the End",p=5,d="You have entered the heart of destruction and valiantly defeated the world devourer. By your actions you have postponed the end of the world — at least for a while."},
[398]={n="Vortex Tamer",p=5,d="After a long journey and dedication you were favoured by fortune and have tamed all three elusive beasts of the vortex. Unless the Vortexion decides you're a tasty morsel you can e"},
[399]={n="Forbidden Fruit",p=1,s=1,d="You could not resist the taste of the forbidden fruit. Since you don't feel changed at all, it couldn't have been that bad after all. Or could it?"},
[400]={n="Forbidden Knowledge",p=1,s=1,d="Perhaps with so much acquired knowledge, never meant for you, you know even when to stop! Time will tell whether this knowledge will do more harm or good."},
[401]={n="Rhino Rider",p=1,d="Don't forget, even your rhino sometimes needs a hug. A careful one in this case."},
[402]={n="Treasure Hunter",p=3,d="You wandered the world in search of the ancient dragons' hoards. You are sure, you found them all."},
[403]={n="Corruption Contained",p=5,d="You have managed to stall the worst incursion of corruption. Still this is just one battle won in an all out war for your world."},
[404]={n="Fairy Teasing",p=1,s=1,d="Teasing fairies is fun. They leave behind such pretty clouds of glittering dust when chased. Just hope they don't get you back for it."},
[405]={n="Toothfairy Assistant",p=1,d="You assisted a very prominent fae and you fought tooth and nail to earn this title."},
[406]={n="Buried the Baron",p=1,d="You defeated the Baron from Below and destroyed his lava pump!"},
[407]={n="Contender",p=3,d="You have fully unlocked 10 medium monsters in the cyclopedia."},
[408]={n="Death in the Depths",p=2,d="The Baron from Below, Duke of the Depths and the Count of the Core are no more!"},
[409]={n="Duked It Out",p=1,d="You defeated the Duke of the Depths and destroyed his lava pump!"},
[410]={n="His Days are Counted",p=1,d="You defeated the Count of the Core and destroyed his lava pump!"},
[411]={n="Hunting Permit",p=1,d="You have fully unlocked your very first monster in the cyclopedia."},
[412]={n="Little Adventure",p=1,d="You have fully unlocked 10 easy monsters in the cyclopedia."},
[413]={n="Little Big Adventure",p=2,s=1,d="You have fully unlocked 100 easy monsters in the cyclopedia."},
[414]={n="Master Hunter",p=6,s=1,d="You have fully unlocked 100 hard monsters in the cyclopedia."},
[415]={n="Over the Moon",p=5,d="The Curse of the Full Moon transforms harmless citizens into feral beasts. But with your help, Edron and Cormaya are safe - fairly."},
[416]={n="Scourge of Scarabs",p=3,d="You took the heat and defeated the Ancient Spawn of Morgathla!"},
[417]={n="Serious Contender",p=4,s=1,d="You have fully unlocked 100 medium monsters in the cyclopedia."},
[418]={n="Skilled Hunter",p=5,d="You have fully unlocked 10 hard monsters in the cyclopedia."},
[419]={n="All Hail the King",p=1,d="Old temples, a meadowy countryside and the splendour of Thais - you really know every corner of King' realm now."},
[420]={n="Ancient Splendor",p=1,d="You've braved the perils of Yalahar and learned of its gloomy shadows of long gone greatness."},
[421]={n="Battle Mage",p=6,d="Wielding dangerous knowledge as well as the sword is your expertise. You have proven yourself versatile in all manner of situations."},
[422]={n="Bibliomaniac",p=3,d="You passion for reading was somewhat diminished by biting books and aggressive quills. But this flying specimen proved to be a loyal companion. Never judge a book by its cover!"},
[423]={n="Daraman's Footsteps",p=1,d="You journeyed through Darashia and the sea of sand around it, while fighting the perils of the desert."},
[424]={n="Dwarven Mines",p=1,d="Vast mines, an orc fortress and the magnificence of Kazordoon - you really know every corner of North-Eastern Mainland now."},
[425]={n="Elven Woods",p=1,d="Tall trees, deep forests and and the beauty of Ab'Dendriel - you really know every corner of the elven lands now."},
[426]={n="Glooth Punk",p=1,d="Glooth is the substance that powers a whole continent and all its weird inhabitants, workshops and factories. You travelled this strange smorgasbord of curiosities in its entirety "},
[427]={n="High and Dry",p=2,d="You asked Captain Charles to take a shortcut quite a few times. Now you are all too familiar with desert islands all over the world."},
[428]={n="Jewel in the Swamp",p=1,d="Damp swamps, a dry desert and the opulence of Venore - you really know every corner of Eastern Mainland now."},
[429]={n="King of the Jungle",p=1,d="You have searched Port Hope and the jungle that thoroughly, that you are up to adoption by a friendly ape family."},
[430]={n="Liberty Bay Watch",p=1,d="A pirate's haven and a burglar's hideout. You found your way around Liberty Bay and its surroundings - land, ho!"},
[431]={n="Library Liberator",p=3,d="Though you couldn't prevent the theft of the godbreaker knowledge, you still managed to fight of the invasion of the library and to kill the scourge of oblivion, a powerful servant"},
[432]={n="Lizard Kingdom",p=1,d="From the southern steppe through the Dragonblaze Mountains and the Muggy Plains to the forbidden city of Razzachai - you really know every corner of Zao now."},
[433]={n="Long Live the Queen",p=1,d="Ancient battlefields, amazons and the glory of Carlin - you really know every corner of Queen Eloise's realm now."},
[434]={n="Master Debater",p=1,s=1,d="You truly are the grand master of verbal debate! Now going forth and putting this wisdom to good use in everyday life... is probably debatable."},
[435]={n="Millennial Falcon",p=3,s=1,d="You defeated Grand Master Oberon and the remnants of the Order of the Falcon, no matter the odds."},
[436]={n="Mummy's Dearest",p=1,d="You have combed the desert and searched the pyramid city of Ankrahmun."},
[437]={n="Race to the Pole",p=1,d="You have expelled the fog of the unknown from the islands of Svargrond. Maybe not as first, but that's not what matters in the end."},
[438]={n="Realms of Dreams",p=1,d="Lush meadows, colourful fairies and sentient stones - you really know every corner of Feyrist now."},
[439]={n="Spectulation",p=1,s=1,d="You checked out a strange temple deep in the jungles of Tiquanda. Spectulus was right, it was indeed overrun by strange fish-men you now call Deathlings."},
[440]={n="Stronghold of Edron",p=1,d="Strong fortresses, sprawling woods and ivory towers - you really know every corner of Edron now."},
[441]={n="The Ogre Steppe",p=1,d="A vast steppe, voracious ogres and dried out salt seas - you really know every corner of Krailos now."},
[442]={n="Trip to the Beach",p=1,d="Braving a hive full of unimaginable proportions and its grotesque creatures on the surface is only one side of Gray Beach. Your full trip of the island also included a dive into th"},
[443]={n="Twisted Dreams",p=1,d="A journey through a dreamscape of evil is no small feat. Yet you traversed the nightmarish lands of Roshamuul and live to tell the tale. Don't fall asleep now..."},
[444]={n="Widely Travelled",p=7,d="As a true globetrotter you can now show your colours proudly with this extraordinary outfit."},
[445]={n="Exalted Battle Mage",p=2,d="Not only did you master the battlefield as a mage, you were also induced to the most inner secrets of the art of magical warfare and prevailed."},
[446]={n="Running the Rift",p=3,d="You don't just have a permission to ride a rift runner, you literally went through hell and earned it!"},
[447]={n="Champion of Summer",p=2,s=1,d="You have vanquished numerous arena champions in the name of the Summer Court."},
[448]={n="Champion of Winter",p=2,s=1,d="You have vanquished numerous arena champions in the name of the Winter Court."},
[449]={n="Dream Catcher",p=3,d="You are the slayer of the ancient nightmare beast and prevented the nightmare to spread its madness."},
[450]={n="Dream Warrior",p=6,d="You became an acquaintance of the courts of dreams and acquired the right to display your new status and title of 'dream warrior'."},
[451]={n="Keeper of the 7 Keys",p=2,d="You found the Seven Keys to unlock ... no, not the seven seas. But at least seven doors in the realm of dreams."},
[452]={n="Lacewing Catcher",p=3,d="You caught a lacewing moth with your lantern. It will follow you in companionship as the bearer of the lantern will be its guide through the darkness now."},
[453]={n="Moth Whisperer",p=3,d="Your lantern was too bewitching for a hibernal moth. It couldn't withstand and follows you, the bearer of the lantern, now."},
[454]={n="Tied the Knot",p=1,s=1,d="You figured out the right order of spells in the buried cathedral, how enchanting!"},
[455]={n="No Horse Open Sleigh",p=3,d="This sleigh is not driven by magic but pushed by a percht. Hopefully you two get along well together...!"},
[456]={n="Raider in the Dark",p=6,d="But can you truly be one of them?"},
[457]={n="A Study in Scarlett",p=3,s=1,d="You ended the regn of Scarlett Etzel. All-seeing yet blind, ever powerful yet ultimately helpless, she never got a second chance to truly see. Or has she..."},
[458]={n="Avid Spectral Reader",p=1,s=1,d="What draws things to other dimensions, one wonders. You read the almanac at just the right spot to end up... where, of all places? That is the problem with dimensional travel: you "},
[459]={n="Gryphon Rider",p=3,d="Unmasking spies, killing demons, discovering omens, solving puzzles and fighting ogres, manticores and feral sphinxes. - Nobody said it was easy to become a gryphon rider."},
[460]={n="Hippofoddermus",p=1,s=1,d="You did the hippo population of Kilmaresh a great favour. A well-fed hippo is a happy hippo."},
[461]={n="Inquisition's Hand",p=3,s=1,d="You defeated the Lich Knights and became the hand of the Inquisition, allowed to wear their special garb."},
[462]={n="Sculptor Apprentice",p=2,s=1,d="Granted, you didn't carve those lifelike animal figurines yourself. But helping a medusa to find proper objects and even watching her using her petrifying gaze is almost as rewardi"},
[463]={n="Sun and Sea",p=5,d="You made sure that the balance of sun and sea is preserved in Kilmaresh. The Golden City of Issavi won't forget your favour."},
[464]={n="The Empire's Glory",p=1,d="Mythical creatures, forgotten catacombs and the Golden City - you really know every corner of Kilmaresh now."},
[465]={n="Do a Barrel Roll!",p=3,d="Riding a traditional beer barrel from the Orcsoberfest is a once-in-a-lifetime experience. Beer sold separately."},
[466]={n="Orcsoberfest Welcome",p=3,s=1,d="The Orcsoberfest is not only known for its traditional food, beer and customs but also fun events and excitement! You took part in all of that and can now truly say: \"I survived!\""},
[467]={n="Traditionalist",p=0,d="You proudly wear the traditional Orcsoberfest garb, same as it ever was and as it always will be."},
[468]={n="Beyonder",p=3,d="Adventurous beyond death, you travelled the Netherworld. Although you had just the ghost of a chance you survived and even came back from the realm of the dead."},
[469]={n="Falconer",p=3,d="A true beastmaster learns the language of his animal companions. Now you as well can bolster your unique bond with nature and help preserve the balance of life as a proud falconer."},
[470]={n="Mainstreet Nightmare",p=2,d="Now you are able to wander around the world wearing an angst-inducing vestment."},
[471]={n="Monsterhunter",p=2,d="Fear me, monsters! There is some more slaying to come!"},
[472]={n="Nothing but Hot Air",p=2,d="You have tamed the ghostly mists to do your bidding. For now ..."},
[473]={n="Prospectre",p=1,s=1,d="You made acquaintance with the Thaian. A strange contemporary with a dark history. No man but a derivate of green and obsession."},
[474]={n="Steppe Elegance",p=2,d="Champion of the wildlands, a swift strider among the creatures of the wild. The elegant nature of the gallop, this envoy of speed has mastered, indicates the precise understanding "},
[475]={n="Taskmaster",p=2,d="Having hunted and bested them all, you live for the thrill of the hunt!"},
[476]={n="Verminbane",p=2,d="And so it begins!"},
[477]={n="Up the Molehill",p=3,d="Putting this candle stump on your new mount was kind of a waiting game. You're even tempted to call it whack-a-mole. But in the end you found a loyal companion for your journeys in"},
[478]={n="Areas of Effect",p=3,d="Wisely contributing your resources to areas, you pushed creatures to maximum effect, allowing improved respawn for everyone! Well done!"},
[479]={n="Drama in Darama",p=3,d="f a pride of lions and a pack of hyaenas feud, it is not called a catfight but a ... whatsoever. For sure, it caused a lot of drama in the Darama Desert."},
[480]={n="Lionheart",p=3,d="You bested the maleficent duo Drume and Fugue and restored order to the besieged town of Bounac. You conquered the exotic stronghold of the Order of the Cobra and bested the undead"},
[481]={n="Malefitz",p=1,s=1,d="Made acquaintance with three brothers Fitz."},
[482]={n="Unleash the Beast",p=8,d="You defeated the manifestation of Goshnar's evil traits by fighting your way through beasts you didn't even want to imagine. It transformed you and now you can also look the part."},
[483]={n="Well Roared, Lion!",p=1,d="You helped Domizian and thus proved yourself worthy to enter the werelion sanctum underneath Lion's Rock. You faced the mighty werelions there and one of the rare white lions even "},
[484]={n="You Got Horse Power",p=8,d="Brought back to the realm of the living this magnificent creature will carry you through death and everything that lays beyond."},
[485]={n="Honorary Rascoohan",p=2,d="When in Rascacoon, do as the Rascoohans do!"},
[486]={n="Pied Piper",p=3,d="You are not exactly the Pied Piper of Hamelin but at least you managed to fend off a decent amount of pirats and helped to keep them out of the cities."},
[487]={n="Release the Kraken",p=3,d="Riding around on this squishy companion gives you the feeling of flying through the air... uhm... swimming through the seven seas!"},
[488]={n="Bounacean Chivalry",p=2,s=1,d="Yselda forever stands watch against the carnisylvan menace. Ever awake, waiting in the dark, her heart longs to be united with her king once again. Deep empathy let a hero to bring"},
[489]={n="Citizen of Issavi",p=2,d="It was not the first time that you helped the Sapphire Blade or the Midnight Flame with a difficult task. You may now wear the Kilmareshian robes as well as the tagralt blade and t"},
[490]={n="Hot on the Trail",p=3,d="Since it is fireproof, this flaming creature feels right at home in raging infernos. But remember: just because it doesn't burn, you still do!"},
[491]={n="King's Council",p=3,d="Your continued efforts in keeping Bounac and the people of Kesar the Younger safe, earned you a permanent place at the royal court as an advisor to the king."},
[492]={n="Knowledge Raider",p=3,d="Your thirst for knowledge is insatiable. In the task of helping your gnomish friends, flawless execution is just the icing on the cake."},
[493]={n="Phantastic!",p=3,d="This mighty pachyderm will march into battle as if just taking its Sunday stroll. The cost of friendship was only a few drome points!"},
[494]={n="Shell we take a Ride",p=3,d="Equipped with the shell of a tortoise and claws of a lobster this insect like companion will help you through every hardship."},
[495]={n="Some Like It Hot",p=2,d="You have braved the searing heat in the tunnels deep below Kazordoon and vanquished the Brainstealer. The voices inside your head are finally silenced."},
[496]={n="Woodcarver",p=3,s=1,d="You defeated Megasylvan Yselda in the wake of the sleeping carnisylvan menace deep under Bounac."},
}
-- 10.10.2026: how OurTibia's own mechanics give an achievement (shown in the tooltip)
local HOW={
 ["Areas of Effect"]="Donate 1,000,000 gold in total to the respawn fund: type !donate <amount> (gold from backpack or bank, !donate alone shows the fund). Every full 1,000,000 gold in the fund gives everyone 1 hour of faster respawns.",
 ["A Study in Scarlett"]="Cobra Bastion: step on the stone tile in front of the arena wall (level 150, once per 20 hours) and defeat Scarlett Etzel.",
 ["Avid Spectral Reader"]="Not available yet: it needs Oberon's quest content that is not on OurTibia.",
 ["Banebringers' Bane"]="Bewitched event (every weekend, Friday 18:00 - Sunday 18:00, witches' cauldron east of Venore): earn 300 favour points by bringing ingredients (!bewitched).",
 ["Honorary Witch"]="Bewitched event (weekends, witches' cauldron east of Venore): earn 1500 favour points in total.",
 ["Baby Sitter"]="Not available yet: comes with the Demon's Lullaby event (not on OurTibia yet).",
 ["Nanny from Hell"]="Not available yet: comes with the Demon's Lullaby event (not on OurTibia yet).",
 ["Bad Timing"]="A multitool sometimes fails when you use it on a rope spot (\"Argh! Not now!\") - it has to happen 10 times.",
 ["Back from the Dead"]="Defeat Zanakeph (Grizzly Adams boss).",
 ["Widely Travelled"]="Discover every place of every region: near each place a small flame flickers somewhere - step next to it (!explore lists the missing places).",
}
for _,a in pairs(ACH_DATA) do if HOW[a.n] then a.how=HOW[a.n] end end
for _,name in ipairs({"All Hail the King","Long Live the Queen","Elven Woods","Dwarven Mines","Jewel in the Swamp","Stronghold of Edron","Daraman's Footsteps","Mummy's Dearest","King of the Jungle","Liberty Bay Watch","Race to the Pole","Ancient Splendor","Lizard Kingdom","Glooth Punk","Twisted Dreams","The Ogre Steppe","Trip to the Beach"}) do
 for _,a in pairs(ACH_DATA) do if a.n==name and not a.how then a.how="Exploration: near every place of the region a small flame flickers somewhere (it moves after each server save) - step next to it. !explore lists the missing places." end end
end
